cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Rescue Radar, please cite this repository and the HumAID dataset it is built on."
title: "Rescue Radar: real-time triage of disaster posts with a LoRA-tuned open model"
abstract: >-
  Rescue Radar classifies social media posts written during disasters into the HumAID humanitarian
  categories and routes rescue-critical posts to a dispatcher's priority queue. It fine-tunes NVIDIA
  Nemotron 3.5 Super with LoRA on Fireworks serverless training and evaluates on disasters held out
  from training, against Claude Opus 5.5 and the untuned base model.
type: software
